00:59:45.810 --> 00:59:48.400
<v Miles>Are those Nazis real Nazis?
<v Miles>那些纳粹是真的纳粹吗？

00:59:48.400 --> 00:59:53.400
<v David Kestenbaum>I'm David Kestenbaum. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v David Kestenbaum>我是戴维·凯斯滕鲍姆。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
